- We have List<Order> orders, each order has List<Item> items, each item has price and category. Find the total price of all orders by category. 
Use only one stream pipeline to solve this problem.

- My answer
```
 orders.stream().map(e -> e.getItems())
 .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(Item::getCategory(), Collectors.summingDouble(Item::getPrice)));
